LAST-MODIFIED:20260304T195445Z
UID:10007414-1780772400-1780777800@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:Rhythm & Reels - Sweet Dream Concert
DESCRIPTION:Join us on select Saturday evenings at the Apex Nature Park Amphitheatre for a night of music and movies under the stars. Our 2026 music lineup boasts a variety of genres from soul to honky tonk\, Americana and beyond! So come groove with rising star Tre.Charles\, rock out with Greensboro’s Sweet Dream\, and enjoy family favorite movies under the stars at #R&RApex\nBring your family and friends\, pack a picnic basket\, and come enjoy a memorable\, magical summer evening!\nConcerts begin at 7:00pm\, movies begin at dusk.\nTo learn more about the event visit thehalle.org!
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/rhythm-reels-sweet-dream-concert/
LOCATION:The Halle Cultural Arts Center\, 237 N. Salem St.\, Apex\, NC\, 27332\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/RR-social-posts-9.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Halle Cultural Arts Center":MAILTO:halleculturalartscenter@apexnc.org
END:VEVENT
