SUMMARY:Burning Coal Theatre Presents Danger! by Lucius Robinson
DESCRIPTION:A wild solo show about a man who is convinced his neighbor’s son is a changeling\, and the lengths he will go to prove this monster lives among us. Originally seen at the Charm City Fringe Festival\, as well as festivals in California\, Kansas City and Rhode Island\, Raleigh native Lucius Robinson returns for a third summer with Burning Coal.\n**This production is part of Burning Coal’s Second Stage Series\, “Wait ‘Til You See This”**
